## Success Criteria
- **Primary Goal**: Autonomous **Kiro CLI (headless)**-powered reviewer runs on every PR to `dev`, comments, blocks on high-severity findings, and auto-approves clean PRs.
- **Key Deliverables**:
  - `.github/workflows/pr-review.yml`
  - `pr-review-agent/` Python module (diff fetch, Kiro CLI invocation, severity classification, GitHub posting)
  - Documented repo config: `KIRO_API_KEY` secret + branch-protection required check
  - Unit tests + property-based tests + integration test instructions
- **Quality Gates**:
  - Security Baseline compliance (blocking) at each applicable stage
  - PBT (Full) compliance (blocking) for pure logic
  - `cdk synth` still passes; existing `ci.yml` unaffected
- **Integration Testing**: Agent correctly comments/blocks/approves against a sample PR (mocked or dry-run)
